"The Artonan Triplanetary Government made the 1963 agreement with Earth."
"It rules the Triplanets, the Artonan worlds Artona I, Artona 2 and Artona 3."
"Class assignments follow the services it expects to need from human summons in coming decades."
"It needs no registration, since all selectee information reaches it at once."
"The Triplanets hold nearly thirty-five billion people and have no monarchies today."
"Originally only the Mother planet and Artona II existed as Artonan worlds."
"Travel to some Artonan-held places, like Moon Thegund, needs an Artona I passport."
"It is less hands-on with Earth now than in the early decades."
"Contract-to-Contract messages are private; messages to a knight's ship go through government."
"An Artona weekend comes about every thirteen Earth days."
